<title>POLAND: Exbud second tranche oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Exbud second tranche oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of the Polish construction company Exbud SA registered for 1,839,981 of the 1,270,387 rights offered in a second tranche at 23 zlotys per share, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the first tranche in August 729,613 shares of the two-million one-for-four rights issue were subscribed.</p>
<p>The company said the shares would be allotted to investors by the National Securities Depository (KDPW) on September 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
